  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>本模组已重新设计！！！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>谢谢你，东非大野猪！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">本模组包含的 zylob:acg_trail 剑刃特效源自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-acgpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic ACG</a> 的资源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">若要体验本模组的完整功能，请添加&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-trail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Trail</a> 模组。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">当您添加 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-trail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Trail</a></span></span> 模组或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight-Nightfall</a>&nbsp;模组时，来自这些模组的剑刃特效将自动加入列表。<br><br>本模组仍在持续更新中。目前仅支持 1.20.1 版本，后续将陆续跟进更新。其他版本可能会在稍后推出。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">当前，本模组主要聚焦于 Minecraft 1.20.1 最新版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>&nbsp;模组，并将优先为此版本提供更新。<br><br>当前设置会替换全局的 <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">epicfight:swing_trail</span> 剑刃轨迹粒子，并在生成任何剑刃轨迹粒子时同步生成其他粒子。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>全局配置用于设置非玩家实体的挥击轨迹。当然，更亮的设置同样适用于玩家。另一项设置属于个人偏好，但其他玩家也能看到。</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#000\">描述内容均由 Bing 翻译。（ ）</span></span><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1299983/description_442c1dff-214c-4086-bec4-dbd0f6b1577d.png\" width=\"423\" height=\"365\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1299983/description_9c8e8455-545d-4950-a9d0-9348866896e8.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"367\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1299983/description_798efd52-87ff-4664-b1ab-2917435da77d.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"360\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#5a5a5a\"><strong>大概是这种感觉吧？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1299983/description_edaef3c6-dc79-4e51-92d7-ed5ba930538f.png\" width=\"821\" height=\"501\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><br>请尽量保持重叠的挥击光效数量最少，因为我实际上是在生成挥击光效的同时生成这些粒子，如果重叠过多会导致严重的卡顿。<br></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
